{"c":[{"name":"20261005T204550Z-3e3d4d7a0bdec136","text":"Hosts before v2/answers throw on an unknown memoryDocument id, losing the whole memory list; the server lists answers.md only to hosts with the savedAnswers capability.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T205140Z-7ef033e31edcf1b4","text":"P1: helper/test/setup/no-groq.ts (vitest setupFiles) fails any test file that reads process.env.GROQ_API_KEY, even if the throw is caught; pass explicit env objects to readKey/writersOnStart in tests.","type":"note"}]}
